    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que recupera todos los conceptos relacionados con el Concept ID 192671 (\"hemorragia gastrointestinal\"), utilizando las tablas `concept` y `concept_relationship`:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS source_domain,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain\nFROM\n    concept c1\nJOIN\n    concept_relationship cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    concept c2 ON cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 192671\n\nUNION ALL\n\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS source_domain,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain\nFROM\n    concept c1\nJOIN\n    concept_relationship cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_2\nJOIN\n    concept c2 ON cr.concept_id_1 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 192671;\n```"
          }
        ],
        "role": "model"
      },
