    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "La consulta SQL ha sido revisada y mejorada para incluir la condición `cr.invalid_reason IS NULL` y proporcionar campos adicionales para el concepto relacionado (`concept_code`, `concept_class_id`, `vocabulary_id`), tal como lo solicitó el evaluador.\n\nAquí tienes la consulta SQL corregida y ejecutable para BigQuery:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS source_domain,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain,\n    c2.concept_code AS related_concept_code,\n    c2.concept_class_id AS related_concept_class_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS related_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    concept c1\nJOIN\n    concept_relationship cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    concept c2 ON cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 192671\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL\n\nUNION ALL\n\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    c1.domain_id AS source_domain,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    c2.concept_id AS related_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS related_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS related_domain,\n    c2.concept_code AS related_concept_code,\n    c2.concept_class_id AS related_concept_class_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS related_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    concept c1\nJOIN\n    concept_relationship cr ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_2\nJOIN\n    concept c2 ON cr.concept_id_1 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 192671\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL;\n```"
          }
        ],
